WEBVTT

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.160
Is it true that they have hearts?

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.540
The twins who came here before said that.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.500
That's strange, huh?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.200
For them to have hearts if they're robots.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.200
So, what do YOU think?

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.580
Yeah. That's strange, isn't it?

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:26.620
It's not like we can talk to each other
or play with each other, huh?

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.620
Still... When you're inside them,
sometimes you feel it.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.200
Like, you want to do your best with them.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.040
You want to protect them.
That kind of feeling.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:43.200
But instead of words,
it's said using your hands.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.790
I'm sorry. Is this too hard?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:57.830
Still, when the day comes
that you pilot the Nebula...

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:01.120
When that day comes, I'm sure...

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.830
S.O.S. kikoeta

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:27.750
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.750
Kakko kawaiku ne

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.290
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.120
Onaji na no kashira

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.660
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.660
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:04.040
Honki misechau yo, kanaechau kara

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:07.910
Sora o tsukinuketa sekai de

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:14.870
Fushigi na omoi kanjita yo, shunkan de suki!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.950
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.290
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:28.830
Naiteta chiisa na watashi ga tachimukau

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.160
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.500
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:42.580
Binetsu na kibun wa anata no sei kamo, S.O.S.!

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:56.290
Connectors 5 through 16 have been attached.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.120
Dissonance [Static]

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.120
Now look, make sure
that you're monitoring this.
Connectors 5 through 16 have been attached.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:03.500
We've finally made it this far,
so let's knock this out of the park!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.660
We're counting on you too, Ribbon!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.120
Okay.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.040
Yeah, but still...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.750
This is Harmonizing?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.370
Yes. You know that each iDOL
has its own output characteristics, right?

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:24.290
That's just like you all.
You have your own, individual quirks.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:29.580
It's not just raw ability: How you're feeling
that day, your mental state, it's all included.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:30.750
Quirks?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.290
We adjust the iDOLs to match those quirks.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:39.160
To draw an example, it's like tuning
an instrument to match the player.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.450
I-I don't really get it,
but that's pretty incredible.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.200
But, will things really go that smoothly?

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:49.250
It's not like this doesn't concern you, Iori.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:54.080
We want you to board the Nebula
and initiate Harmonizing.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.120
Iori!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.290
Me? And the Nebula?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.080
Hurry up and get changed.
And do your best.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.410
Ma'am!

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.370
The Imber has completed Harmonizing prep.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.700
All observers, please report
to your assigned positions.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.790
Ribbon?

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:13.660
I'm okay.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:19.580
Setup of all monitoring equipment is
confirmed. Whenever you're ready, Ami.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.580
Initiating Harmonizer.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:33.620
System stability is confirmed.
Beginning adjustment.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:34.120
Wow.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.120
Please create a loop for primary gain.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.580
It's wonderful!
Please create a loop for primary gain.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.200
Ma'am!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:42.330
Applying a delay of 0.025
to code progress for base syntax.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:47.330
What is this? The maximum
output values are increasing!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.620
Incredible.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.080
Check complete through No. 80.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:01.080
Haruka, please try opening up
the accelerator a little at a time.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.750
Um, okay.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.250
Just like watching a
concert performance, isn't it?

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.450
We're still at the first stage.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:17.500
With more Harmonizing,
I think the specs will continue to improve.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.370
That's splendid.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.040
The Nebula has completed Harmonizing prep.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.370
All staff, please report to your assigned positions.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:29.370
All right, let's go, Nebula!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:34.910
Iori. Your pulse rate is increasing.
You should relax a little.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.160
I know that!

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.160
Initiating Harmonizer.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:47.200
Duplex reduction has cleared
the synch threshold.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.700
This is a new record for Iori and the Nebula.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:54.200
Incredible. Iori, it's incredible!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.120
Phase 3 complete.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.580
Nerve dampeners are off.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.370
Please stand by to shift
to Attenuation mode.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.290
Nebula...
Please stand by to shift
to Attenuation mode.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.580
Good work!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:11.790
According to the chief, it looks like
you got some good results.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.200
Great ones.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.660
O-oh, really?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:33.040
Next, we'll begin Harmonizing the Nebula
with Makoto Kikuchi.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:37.750
All staff to your assigned stations.
Ami, if you please.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.080
Understood.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.290
That was interesting!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.870
Maintenance 2

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:48.540
Say, what is Harmonizing like, specifically?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.750
Oh, well...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:56.580
If I had to say, Haruka is like this.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:01.080
And Iori is like this.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:05.290
Makoto is... like this, maybe.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.450
Um... You don't understand?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.750
Come on, everyone! You're being rude
to your esteemed senior!

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:18.910
"Esteemed senior"?

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:22.620
Maintenance 2

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.620
That's right. Thank you very much
for today, upperclassman.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.410
No, I should be thanking you.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:30.330
Today's results were because of
everyone's excellent maintenance.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:37.040
Your love for machines and devotion
to the job has nurtured the iDOLs.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.660
It was quite an experience.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:40.870
Upperclassman!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:42.870
You're the best!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.580
H-hey, hold on a moment!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:54.790
To have results like this after
a single Harmonizing...

00:07:55.250 --> 00:08:01.290
The Imber and Miss Amami are going as
expected. The problem is with the Nebula.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:08.620
If we're to look at rates of growth, Miss
Minase's is far above that of Miss Kikuchi.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.330
That being said, Makoto
is still in the lead overall.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.200
If we add her results up till now, that is.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:19.910
Difficult, isn't it? There's also
the problem of rotation...

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.910
What do you think, Miss Futami?

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.410
I...

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.700
I will now announce changes
to the rotation schedule

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.160
as a result of last time's Harmonizing.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:39.000
The Imber's Master is
Haruka Amami, no change.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:44.500
The Nebula's Master is Iori Minase.
Her backup is Makoto Kikuchi.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:47.700
This is only how things
stand for the present.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:51.500
How they go from here is up to you.
Do your best.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.120
Ma'am!

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.410
M-me?

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.290
Congratulations, Iori!

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.580
This concludes our meeting.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.080
Good thing, huh, Iori?

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.830
They've recognized how hard
you've worked. It's great!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.040
Iori?

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.910
I did it.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.830
I did it!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.700
I did it!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.830
Why did you come back?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.500
What happened seven years ago...

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.000
You haven't forgotten that, have you? No...

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.120
There's no way you could forget it.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.750
Why did you come back?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.080
I want to make sure.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.370
Make sure?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:12.580
The first time I heard Imber's
melody, I felt something.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:17.040
A special "something,"
which I'd never felt before.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.700
That's why I came back.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:27.040
Because that something might lead
to the answer I'm looking for.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.160
That was my thinking.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.500
Now YOU'RE talking like that?

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:35.870
The iDOLs are MACHINES, right?!
Just lumps of steel and silicon.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.250
You're wrong.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.370
The iDOLs can teach us.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:46.040
With beautiful resonance, they sing
what they seek from their Masters.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.290
That is one of the reasons
for the results I provided.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.660
What do those numbers even mean?!
That's not real combat!

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:57.370
For that, you need the right skills
and proper judgment!

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.540
I do things MY way,
have done so this whole time!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:08.540
But the way you are now, you can't
ever grow above your current level.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.330
Nebula knows that.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:13.450
Shut up.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.160
You know that yourself, don't you?

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.660
Shut up!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.290
You just don't want to accept it.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.660
There's no way the iDOLs have hearts.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.000
How could I stand it if they did?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.250
If they have hearts...

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:40.700
Why?

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.200
Why would they do that?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.250
I don't accept it. Not me.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.950
I don't accept it!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.200
Recovery duty?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.160
Yes. It's a request from
Geneva's supplies division.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.950
They want us to retrieve a lunar fragment.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:13.500
Our next anti-Drop engagement
is a long way off,

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.660
and it's perfect for testing the iDOLs
after their Harmonizing, right?

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.450
I'll provide you with
detailed documents later.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.910
Ma'am!

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.950
These are the documents you asked for.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:28.660
Thank you.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:35.790
You sure are dedicated, Iori. You go out
tomorrow, so to be doing this so late...

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:37.950
Better safe than sorry.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:47.120
Also, it's like every minute, every second
I spend on the Nebula energizes me.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.370
I couldn't stop myself if I tried.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.660
That's just like Haruka, isn't it?

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:58.830
What are you talking about?
Don't compare me to that Idiot Ribbon!

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:00.250
I'm sorry.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.450
I won't accept it.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.250
It's this late already, huh?

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:00.700
Please do your best. I'm sure you'll
have no problems, Iori!

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.950
Of course not.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:05.200
I'll finish things and get home in a flash,

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.830
so get things ready for
the party and wait for me.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.080
Understood!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.660
See you.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.370
Good luck!

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.080
Here we go, Nebula!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.580
Prometheus 2 activation confirmed.
Proceeding to stage 2.

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.620
Course confirmed and clear.
Activating main shaft.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.950
Channels 5 and 47 have been secured.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:50.040
We have completed our
announcement to Mondenkind NA.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.660
We have confirmation of Candy Catcher
launch from Tanega Island.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.410
Nebula, deploy!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:04.290
If they have it, then show me...

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.290
The Nebula is proceeding to Channel 47.

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.120
Flight plan has been received from
trajectory admin center.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.290
The proof of their hearts.
Flight plan has been received from
trajectory admin center.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.870
Say, what should we do for the party?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:19.950
It's been a while,
so maybe we should do karaoke.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.700
I hear they've added Ami's latest song.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.870
Yukiho...

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.450
Prometheus 2 has docked
with the Candy Catcher.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.620
She will now proceed on
accelerated orbit toward the target.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.290
The mission has moved to Phase 3.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.160
You're doing great, Iori.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.080
Of course!

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.370
Prometheus 2 is on approach to the target.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:52.160
Now firing reverse thrusters.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.200
Set relative speed to zero.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.200
Iori?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.830
The target has been secured.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:25.500
Heat-resistant film has been deployed.
Layer field deployment is also confirmed.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.500
Phase 3 complete.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:32.080
Now moving to Phase 4.
Return route is laid in.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:36.160
That was perfect! Iori,
looks like you had no blanks.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:41.410
Next up is the final phase.
Do your best, and keep your guard up.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.580
Understood!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.080
Prometheus 2 has entered return orbit.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:55.750
Don't forget to inform Mondenkind NA.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:56.830
Ma'am!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:17.290
Come on, Yukiho! Iori will be
coming back, so it's...

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.950
An emergency scramble?

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.620
Haruka?

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:29.080
Frame stress for the Prometheus 2
has reached dangerous levels.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.870
She's too close to the Earth. At this speed...

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:34.330
Iori? What's wrong? Iori!

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.200
What's happened?

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.040
Miss Amami.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.750
What happened to Iori?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:43.120
The Nebula made a mistake
on its approach back to Earth.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:48.080
At this rate, she has no control
and will crash into the Earth.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.250
Oh, no!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.290
Incoming message from Mondenkind NA!

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.540
The target is considered a Cherry.
They've issued orders to engage!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.750
Destroy the target!
The mission has changed:

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.160
securing the iDOL and
its Master takes priority!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:04.950
Haruka and Yukiho, get ready to
provide backup in the Imber.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:11.330
Iori! Destroy the target right now!
They've issued orders to engage!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.830
Are you listening, Iori?! Please respond!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:20.330
No... Why?! This can't be! Not this...

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.330
No! Please. Nebula!

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:34.250
Mondenkind NA missile launch
is confirmed!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.910
Twenty seconds to impact!

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.000
Unable to restore communications
with the Nebula!

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:40.950
Keep trying. What about the Imber?

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.750
It will be on stage soon.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:55.620
Iori! Iori!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.790
Warheads have begun final acceleration.
Iori! Iori!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.830
It's too late!

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:01.790
Iori!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.200
No, it can't be!

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.950
How has Iori been?

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:20.160
Her medical observation ends today,
so she could be at the dorm by now.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:24.120
So, what was the cause of the accident?

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.870
A calculation error in the Drop's mass.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:32.830
The Master, not noticing that,
threw the frame completely off balance.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:35.700
No way! Iori wouldn't make
a mistake like that!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:40.620
That was my thinking, too.
But that's what the data says.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.330
What will happen to Iori?

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:44.830
The top brass is after her

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.620
about the cost of the missiles
and just how dangerous this was,

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.700
but this was such a major incident

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:56.160
that I don't think it will be
Iori's responsibility alone.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.250
Still...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.660
"Still"?

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:03.750
I think there's no doubt that she'll
no longer be the Nebula's Master.

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.750
No way!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.160
So much for her streak of good luck, huh?

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:11.250
All we can do now is leave her be.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.660
But...

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.830
Both of you have work to do, right?

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.950
I understand how you feel,
but you can't let it drag you down.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.540
What did I say?

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:34.580
I knew it. They don't have hearts.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.910
Dammit.

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:43.580
Dammit!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.120
So you're back.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.750
You drink this too, right? Makoto.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.040
You went into my room?

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:06.250
I went ahead and changed
my system password today.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:09.700
Want me to tell you what it is again?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.620
That's not necessary, is it?

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.700
A fourth iDOL?

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.450
Yes. Mondenkind EU informed us

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:40.000
that a reading resembling
that was picked up in Iceland.

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:46.000
We've also received word that Turiavita has
their eye on it, and has made their move.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:51.910
We want the two of you to take
the Imber and the Nebula and head there.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.910
Ma'am!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:05.200
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:14.200
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:23.080
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:31.620
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:43.080
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:52.040
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:52.040 --> 00:23:01.000
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:12.580
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:40.950
Preview
Niflheim

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:28.790
Nice to meet you, I'm Ami Futami.

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:32.910
Come on, don't be so formal.
You can say whatever you like here.

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:35.790
That just won't do.
Not for a youngster like me.

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:36.950
Y-you're so humble

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:39.830
That's how you make it in
the entertainment world.
